    <name>Sweet Spot (58min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 7min from 50% to 70% FTP | Steady: 12min @ 85% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 12min @ 87% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 12min @ 88% FTP | Cooldown: 7min from 70% to 50% FTP</description>
